<section class="container pb-5"><div class="row g-4 align-items-start"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="surface surface-pad"><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="<?= e(url('payment-submit')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="id_reservasi" value="<?= (int) $booking['id_reservasi'] ?>"><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="nominal">Nominal transfer (Rp)</label><input class="form-control" type="number" name="nominal" id="nominal" min="<?= (int) $minimumPayment ?>" max="<?= (int) ceil($outstanding) ?>" step="1" required value="<?= (int) ceil($outstanding) ?>"><div class="form-note mt-2">Sisa tagihan Rp <?= number_format($outstanding,0,',','.') ?>. Pembayaran pertama minimal 30% (<?= money($minimumPayment) ?>), pembayaran berikutnya sesuai sisa tagihan.</div></div><div class="mb-3"><label class="form-label" for="jenis_pembayaran">Jenis pembayaran</label><select class="form-select" id="jenis_pembayaran" name="jenis_pembayaran"><option value="dp">Uang muka (DP)</option><option value="pelunasan">Pelunasan / cicilan lanjutan</option><option value="penuh">Bayar penuh</option></select><div class="form-note mt-2">Jenis akan disesuaikan otomatis bila nominal melunasi seluruh sisa tagihan.</div></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="form-label" for="bukti">Bukti transfer (JPG, PNG, WebP)</label><input class="form-control" type="file" name="bukti" id="bukti" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" required><div class="form-note mt-2">Ukuran maksimal <?= (int) $GLOBALS['config']['upload_max_mb'] ?> MB. Foto akan disimpan privat dan divalidasi kembali di server.</div></div><div class="file-hint mb-4">Pastikan bukti menampilkan nominal dan waktu transfer yang terbaca. Jangan unggah dokumen yang memuat data rahasia yang tidak terkait pembayaran.</div><button class="btn btn-copper btn-lg w-100" type="submit">Kirim Bukti untuk Verifikasi ↗</button></form></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="surface surface-pad"><span class="secti